Wine gdiplus: path gradients honour focus scales, blend, preset blend and gamma; text centred on a zero-width box is centred. Fixes the FSLabs display glow and the MCDU and clock letters.
Applies to wine-cachyos with: patch -p1 --forward --fuzz=0 -i <this file>

